Reason: Give class id 14 (the Witch Doctor) its entry in the six per-class dodge/miss/parry tables patches 0024 and 0030 stopped at the Necromancer on: the Warlock's values, its parent, so slot 14 is not 0/0. Patch 0024 raised MAX_CLASSES to 15 and put bits 11-13 in the playable mask, which already carries id 14 (bit 13); the six tables are zero-initialised past their last entry, and the diminishing formulas divide `0 * cap / (0 + cap * k)`, which is 0/0 = NaN when the defense-rating term is 0 (a Witch Doctor's miss chance, parry and dodge). The mask and MAX_CLASSES are untouched.
Target: AzerothCore at core-commit.txt, after patches 0024 and 0030 (it edits the lines 0030 added; it applies with or without 0025-0029 and 0031, which sit in other lines).

